  "emailBody": "\n        <html>\n\n        <body\n            style=\"\n                font-family:Segoe UI, Arial, sans-serif;\n                margin:20px;\n            \"\n        >\n\n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    background:#d42e12;\n                    color:white;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                \"\n            >\n\n\n               <h1 style=\"margin:0;\">\n                    Fuel Market Intelligence Afternoon Report\n                </h1>\n\n                <p style=\"margin:5px 0 0 0;\">\n                    13 August 2026\n                </p>\n\n            </div>\n\n            <p\n                style=\"\n                    font-size:16px;\n                    margin-top:20px;\n                    margin-bottom:20px;\n                \"\n            >\n                Good afternoon Sir,\n                <br><br>\n                \n                Here is today's fuel market intelligence report highlighting\n                the latest PMS and AGO depot prices together with key industry\n                developments and market news.\n            </p>\n\n            <br>\n\n            \n        <h2 style=\"color:#d42e12;\">\n            PMS Prices\n        </h2>\n\n        <div\n            style=\"\n                background:#fad5a1;\n                padding:12px;\n                border-left:5px solid #f28e05;\n                margin-bottom:10px;\n                font-size:16px;\n                font-weight:bold;\n            \"\n        >\n            Average PMS Prices: ₦1,196.50/L\n        </div>\n\n        <table\n            width=\"100%\"\n            cellspacing=\"0\"\n            cellpadding=\"10\"\n            style=\"\n                border-collapse:collapse;\n                border:1px solid #ddd;\n            \"\n        >\n\n            <tr style=\"background:#d42e12;color:white;\">\n                <th align=\"left\">Depot</th>\n                <th align=\"left\">Price</th>\n            </tr>\n\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>PARKER</td>\n                <td>₦1,215.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>BONO</td>\n                <td>₦1,190.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>INTERGRATED</td>\n                <td>₦1,190.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>AFRICAN TERMINAL</td>\n                <td>₦1,190.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>MATRIX WARRI</td>\n                <td>₦1,215.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>MATRIX PH</td>\n                <td>₦1,212.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>PINNACLE</td>\n                <td>₦1,170.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>ARDOVA</td>\n                <td>₦1,190.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n\n        </table>\n\n        <br>\n        \n\n            \n        <h2 style=\"color:#d42e12;\">\n            AGO Prices\n        </h2>\n\n        <div\n            style=\"\n                background:#fad5a1;\n                padding:12px;\n                border-left:5px solid #f28e05;\n                margin-bottom:10px;\n                font-size:16px;\n                font-weight:bold;\n            \"\n        >\n            Average AGO Prices: ₦1,704.75/L\n        </div>\n\n        <table\n            width=\"100%\"\n            cellspacing=\"0\"\n            cellpadding=\"10\"\n            style=\"\n                border-collapse:collapse;\n                border:1px solid #ddd;\n            \"\n        >\n\n            <tr style=\"background:#d42e12;color:white;\">\n                <th align=\"left\">Depot</th>\n                <th align=\"left\">Price</th>\n            </tr>\n\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>ZAMSON</td>\n                <td>₦1,719.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>NIPCO WARRI</td>\n                <td>₦1,720.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>PRUDENT OGHARA</td>\n                <td>₦1,719.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>IBETO</td>\n                <td>₦1,680.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>BONO</td>\n                <td>₦1,700.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>INTERGRATED</td>\n                <td>₦1,700.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>DUPORT</td>\n                <td>₦1,700.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n            <tr>\n                <td>AFRICAN TERMINAL</td>\n                <td>₦1,700.00</td>\n            </tr>\n            \n\n        </table>\n\n        <br>\n        \n\n            \n        <h2 style=\"color:#d42e12;\">\n            Market News\n        </h2>\n        \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    Oil Prices Retreat as Demand Fears Outweigh Lingering Strait of Hormuz Crisis\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    Oil prices eased as weaker 2026 demand projections from OPEC and the International Energy Agency (IEA) outweighed persistent supply risks linked to the prolonged disruption in the Strait of Hormuz. As at the time of writing 08:15 am (WAT) Brent crude fell 0.48 per cent to $88.55 a barrel, while WTI crude declined 0.53 per% to $82.83.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/oil-prices-retreat-as-demand-fears-outweigh-lingering-strait-of-hormuz-crisis\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    Vessel Arrivals: Pivot, Rainoil, Bovas, Others Receive Fresh PMS, AGO, LPG Cargoes\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    Fresh cargoes of Premium Motor Spirit (PMS), Automotive Gas Oil (AGO) and Liquified Petroleum Gas (LPG) are scheduled for discharge across Lagos and Warri. The latest tanker position report monitored by Petroleumprice.ng shows that Lagos remains the busiest receiving hub.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/vessel-arrivals-pivot-rainoil-bovas-others-receive-fresh-pms-ago-lpg-cargoes\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    We Have ‘Total Control’ of the Strait of Hormuz – Trump\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    US President Donald Trump has claimed that the United States now has “total control” over the Strait of Hormuz. In a post attributed to Trump on Wednesday, he said the US had established what he described as a “wall of steel” around the strait. He indicated that Iran was in no position to challenge the blockade. Trump also portrayed the US military position as evidence that Iran had lost its previous influence.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/we-have-total-control-of-the-strait-of-hormuz-trump\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    Senate Gives Four Oil Firms 48 Hours to Face NEITI Audit Probe\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    The Senate Public Accounts Committee has issued a 48-hour ultimatum to four oil companies. The affected companies are Seplat Energy, Network E&P Nigeria Limited, All Grace Energy Limited and Aradel Energy Limited. The companies were warned that failure to appear could trigger the use of the National Assembly’s constitutional powers to compel their attendance.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/senate-gives-four-oil-firms-48-hours-to-face-neiti-audit-probe\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n            <div\n                style=\"\n                    border:1px solid #fad5a1;\n                    padding:15px;\n                    margin-bottom:15px;\n                    border-radius:8px;\n                    \n                \"\n            >\n\n                <h3>\n                    Trump Confirms Secret Plane Switch After Iran Threat at Turkey Summit\n                </h3>\n\n                <p>\n                    US President Donald Trump confirmed that he was secretly moved from Air Force One to a military aircraft last month. Security officials identified a potential threat linked to Iran during his departure from a NATO summit in Ankara, Türkiye. Trump said on Tuesday that the decision was made by the US Secret Service and military authorities.\n                </p>\n\n                <a\n                    href=\"https://petroleumprice.ng/news/articles/trump-confirms-secret-plane-switch-after-iran-threat-at-turkey-summit\"\n                    target=\"_blank\"\n                    style=\"\n                        color:#d42e12;\n                        font-weight:bold;\n                        text-decoration:none;\n                    \"\n                >\n                    Full Article →\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n            \n\n        </body>\n\n        </html>\n        "
